-- Dependency artifacts listed below are current and schema-valid.
-- A clean worktree and checkpoint exist before any write.
-- Readiness starts as `not-run`.
-
-### Hard dependencies
-
-- `elmos-long-task-checkpoint-recovery`
-
-## Inputs
