-
-- [ ] Java checked exception→Rust Result fixture.
-- [ ] Swift throws fixture.
-- [ ] PHP dynamic exception fixture.
-- [ ] same-snapshot deterministic artifact serialization.
-- [ ] stale evidence/toolchain/assumption invalidation.
